---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="HIPAA Notice | H.O.P.E.S.S."
  description="HIPAA and confidentiality notice information for the H.O.P.E.S.S. website."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">HIPAA Notice</p>
    <h1>Privacy and confidentiality matter in treatment.</h1>
    <p>
      H.O.P.E.S.S. handles treatment-related information with care. Call the program for the full Notice of Privacy
      Practices and current legal or clinical privacy details.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="policy-grid">
    <article>
      <h2>HIPAA</h2>
      <p>Health information may be protected by HIPAA and other healthcare privacy requirements depending on the service and context.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>42 CFR Part 2</h2>
      <p>Substance use treatment information may also be protected by federal confidentiality rules known as 42 CFR Part 2.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Contacting intake</h2>
      <p>This website does not collect callback requests or clinical details. Call intake to discuss treatment.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Call intake</h2>
      <p>For the most private and immediate conversation, call H.O.P.E.S.S. intake directly at (480) 660-5775.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
